{"version":1,"id":"lil-baby-the-bigger-picture","title":"The Bigger Picture","artist":"Lil Baby","key":"Am","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/lil-baby/the-bigger-picture/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":null,"chords":[{"symbol":"Am","canonical":"Am","keyboardPitchClasses":[9,0,4],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"G","canonical":"G","keyboardPitchClasses":[7,11,2],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"F","canonical":"F","keyboardPitchClasses":[5,9,0],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"E","canonical":"E","keyboardPitchClasses":[4,8,11],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"lyric","text":"Trade my 4x4 for a G63, ain't no more free Lil Steve","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":9,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"I gave 'em chance and chance and chance again, I even done told them please","columns":75,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":11,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"I find it crazy the police'll shoot you and know that you dead, but still tell you to freeze","columns":92,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":10,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"Fucked up, I seen what I seen","columns":29,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":13,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"I guess that mean hold him down if he say he can't breathe","columns":58,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"It's too many mothers that's grieving","columns":37,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":14,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"They killing us for no reason","columns":29,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"Been going on for too long to get even","columns":38,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":34,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"Throw us in cages like dogs and hyenas","columns":38,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"I went to court and they sent me to prison","columns":42,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":36,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"My mama was crushed when they said I can't leave","columns":48,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"First I was drunk, then I sobered up quick","columns":42,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":37,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"When I heard all that time that they gave to Taleeb","columns":51,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"He got a life sentence plus","columns":27,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"  We just some products of our environment","columns":42,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"How the fuck they gon' blame us?","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"  You can't fight fire with fire","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"I know, but at least we can turn up the flames some","columns":51,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"  Every colored person ain't dumb and all whites not racist","columns":59,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"  I be judging by the mind and heart, I ain't really into faces","columns":63,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"Fucked up, the way that we livin' is not getting better, you gotta know how to survive","columns":86,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"lyric","text":"Crazy, I had to tell all of my loved ones to carry a gun when they going outside","columns":80,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":"Stare in the mirror whenever you drive","columns":38,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":"Overprotective, go crazy for mine","columns":33,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":"You gotta pay attention to the signs","columns":36,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"lyric","text":"Seem like the blind following the blind","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":"Thinking 'bout everything that's going on","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-28","kind":"lyric","text":"I boost security up at my home","columns":30,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-29","kind":"lyric","text":"I'm with my kind if they right or they wrong","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-30","kind":"lyric","text":"I call him now, he'll pick up the phone","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-31","kind":"lyric","text":"And it's five in the morning, he waking up on it","columns":48,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":9,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-32","kind":"lyric","text":"Tell 'em wherever I'm at, then they comin'","columns":42,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-33","kind":"lyric","text":"I see blue lights, I get scared and start runnin'","columns":49,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-34","kind":"lyric","text":"That shit be crazy, they 'posed to protect us","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-35","kind":"lyric","text":"Throw us in handcuffs and arrest us","columns":35,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-36","kind":"lyric","text":"While they go home at night, that shit messed up","columns":48,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-37","kind":"lyric","text":"Knowing we needed help, they neglect us","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-38","kind":"lyric","text":"Wondering who gon' make them respect us","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-39","kind":"lyric","text":"I can see in your eye that you fed up","columns":37,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-40","kind":"lyric","text":"Fuck around, got my shot, I won't let up","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-41","kind":"lyric","text":"  They know that we a problem together","columns":38,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-42","kind":"lyric","text":"They know that we can storm any weather","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-43","kind":"section","text":"[Chorus]","columns":8,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-44","kind":"lyric","text":"It's bigger than black and white","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":5,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-45","kind":"lyric","text":"It's a problem with the whole way of life","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-46","kind":"lyric","text":"It can't change overnight","columns":25,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":9,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-47","kind":"lyric","text":"But we gotta start somewhere","columns":28,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-48","kind":"lyric","text":"Might as well gon' 'head start here","columns":35,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":14,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-49","kind":"lyric","text":"We done had a hell of a year","columns":28,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-50","kind":"lyric","text":"I'ma make it count while I'm here","columns":33,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":13,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-51","kind":"lyric","text":"God is the only man I fear","columns":26,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-52","kind":"section","text":"[Verse 2]","columns":9,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-53","kind":"lyric","text":"Fuck it, I'm goin' on the front line","columns":36,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-54","kind":"lyric","text":"He gon' bust your ass if you come past that gun line","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-55","kind":"lyric","text":"You know when the storm go away, then the sun shine","columns":51,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":18,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-56","kind":"lyric","text":"You gotta put your head in the game when it's crunch time","columns":57,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-57","kind":"lyric","text":"I want all my sons to grow up to be monsters","columns":44,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":14,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-58","kind":"lyric","text":"I want all my daughters to show out in public","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-59","kind":"lyric","text":"Seems like we losing our country","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":14,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-60","kind":"lyric","text":"But we gotta stand up for something, so this what it comes to","columns":61,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-61","kind":"lyric","text":"Every video I see on my conscience","columns":34,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":6,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-62","kind":"lyric","text":"I got power, now I gotta say somethin'","columns":38,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-63","kind":"lyric","text":"Corrupted police been the problem where I'm from","columns":48,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":10,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-64","kind":"lyric","text":"But I'd be lying if I said it was all of them","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-65","kind":"lyric","text":"I ain't do this for the trend, I don't follow them","columns":50,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":16,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-66","kind":"lyric","text":"Altercations with the law, had a lot of them","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-67","kind":"lyric","text":"People speaking for the people, I'm proud of them","columns":49,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":16,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-68","kind":"lyric","text":"Stick together, we can get it up out of them","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-69","kind":"lyric","text":"I can't lie like I don't rap about killing and dope, but I'm telling my youngins to vote","columns":88,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":12,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-70","kind":"lyric","text":"I did what I did 'cause I didn't have no choice or no hope, I was forced to just jump in and go","columns":95,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":13,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-71","kind":"lyric","text":"This bullshit is all that we know, but it's time for a change","columns":61,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":17,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-72","kind":"lyric","text":"Got time to be serious, no time for no games","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-73","kind":"lyric","text":"We ain't takin' no more, let us go from them chains","columns":51,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":9,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-74","kind":"lyric","text":"God bless they souls, every one of them names","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-75","kind":"section","text":"[Chorus]","columns":8,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-76","kind":"lyric","text":"It's bigger than black and white","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":5,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-77","kind":"lyric","text":"It's a problem with the whole way of life","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-78","kind":"lyric","text":"It can't change overnight","columns":25,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":9,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-79","kind":"lyric","text":"But we gotta start somewhere","columns":28,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-80","kind":"lyric","text":"Might as well gon' 'head start here","columns":35,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":14,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-81","kind":"lyric","text":"We done had a hell of a year","columns":28,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-82","kind":"lyric","text":"I'ma make it count while I'm here","columns":33,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":13,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-83","kind":"lyric","text":"God is the only man I fear","columns":26,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-84","kind":"section","text":"[Verse 3]","columns":9,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-85","kind":"lyric","text":"They trainin' officers to kill us, then shootin' protestors with these rubber bullets","columns":85,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":5,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-86","kind":"lyric","text":"They regular people, I know that they feel it","columns":45,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":13,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-87","kind":"lyric","text":"These scars too deep to heal us","columns":31,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-88","kind":"lyric","text":"What happened to COVID? Nobody remember","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":26,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-89","kind":"lyric","text":"It ain't makin' sense, I'm just here to vent","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-90","kind":"lyric","text":"It happen to one of your people, it's different","columns":47,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":25,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-91","kind":"lyric","text":"We get it, the system is wicked, just learn how to pick it","columns":58,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-92","kind":"lyric","text":"Knowledge is power, I swear I'm a witness, I know that I'm gifted","columns":65,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":13,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-93","kind":"lyric","text":"I won't go too deep 'cause I'm scared they'll get me","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":46,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-94","kind":"lyric","text":"Ain't scared to admit it, some shit I can't mention","columns":51,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-95","kind":"lyric","text":"It's people who can, well, here's the chance","columns":44,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":38,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-96"